- [ ] **Habit Tracker** — Health / Instrument — Track several habits, daily check-ins, streaks, and recent consistency. **Visual:** cheerful yellow Tamagotchi-style pocket board with circular check-ins. **Reference:** `archive/templates/habit-heatmap`.
- [ ] **Trip Itinerary** — Travel / Paper — Organize days, stops, bookings, times, and practical notes. **Visual:** lilac transit board crossed with a boarding pass. **Reference:** `archive/templates/trip-planner`.
- [ ] **Meeting Notes** — Work / Paper — Capture agenda items, freeform notes, decisions, and assigned actions in one document. **Visual:** sober green meeting memo with acid-paper accents. **Reference:** `archive/templates/meeting-notes`.
- [ ] **Personal Budget** — Money / Instrument + Paper — Track income, spending groups, limits, and remaining amounts for a month. **Visual:** graphite pocket calculator fused with a clean paper ledger. **Prior art:** legacy Swift budget and financial tracker templates.
- [ ] **Contact Card** — Personal / Paper + Skin — Edit identity, avatar, contact details, links, location, and a short introduction. **Visual:** translucent mint pager crossed with a compact Rolodex card. **Prior art:** legacy Swift `ContactCRM` template.
- [ ] **Subscription Tracker** — Money / Paper — Track recurring costs, renewal dates, billing periods, and paused services. **Visual:** calm off-white ledger with green renewal signals and tabular totals. **Reference:** `archive/templates/subscription-tracker`.
