- [ ] **Flashcards** — Learning / Instrument — Create decks and review cards using a lightweight spaced-repetition flow. **Visual:** compact school index-card machine with satisfying flip states.
- [ ] **Reading Tracker** — Learning / Paper — Queue, rank, annotate, and finish books or articles. **Visual:** library checkout card with stamped progress and marginal notes.
